  "body": "- **No more cyan bar beside a streaming reply.** The attach TUI (what `mercury` opens) drew the live reply with a cyan `│` strip that disappeared once the reply settled. The live tail now renders exactly like the settled block — same `MERCURY:` header, indent and markdown.\n- **Working/step indicators animate.** The attach TUI showed a frozen `⠋ working…` and static `→` steps; they now run on the shared 100 ms ticker like the main TUI.\n"
}
